# Dockerfile.runtime is produced at build time from the official
# freeipa-container Dockerfile (see scripts/build-image.sh).
#
# Upstream base: Dockerfile.fedora-43 from
#   https://github.com/freeipa/freeipa-container
#
# The generated file keeps the official systemd /data /init stack and only
# replaces Fedora freeipa-* package installation with a local createrepo
# that serves RPMs built from this repository's source tree.
#
# Do not maintain a hand-copied fork of the upstream Dockerfile here.
# Running ./scripts/build-image.sh (or ./up.sh / ./rebuild.sh) regenerates it
# under .build/runtime/Dockerfile.local-rpms (gitignored).
